sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>8081/TCP
    participant ExtProc as ExtProc gRPC Server<br/>9004/TCP TLS (self-signed)
    participant Pipeline as Plugin Pipeline<br/>(pre/profile/post)
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMap<br/>(Kubernetes API)
    participant ModelServer as vLLM Model Server<br/>8000/TCP
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>9090/TCP HTTP
    participant Health as Health gRPC<br/>9005/TCP plaintext
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus

    Note over ExtProc,ConfigMap: Startup: ConfigMap Reconciliation
    ConfigMap->>ExtProc: Watch ConfigMaps (get, list, watch)
    ExtProc->>Pipeline: Update base-model-to-header mapping

    Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 1: Inference Request Processing
    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP
    Envoy->>ExtProc: gRPC ExtProc callout<br/>HTTP/2 | TLS (self-signed cert)
    ExtProc->>Pipeline: Process request headers/body

    Note over Pipeline: Pre-processors:<br/>body-field-to-header extraction<br/>base-model-to-header mapping<br/>request-metadata extraction

    Note over Pipeline: Profile Picker:<br/>Select processing profile

    Note over Pipeline: Model Selection:<br/>group filtering → scoring<br/>(cost-guard, in-flight, session-affinity)<br/>→ picking (random/weighted/max-score)

    Pipeline-->>ExtProc: Modified headers + routing decision
    ExtProc-->>Envoy: ExtProc response<br/>modified headers/body
    Envoy->>ModelServer: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8000
    ModelServer-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy-->>Client: Response

    Note over Pipeline: Post-processors:<br/>response-headers modification<br/>cost-metadata extraction<br/>model-name-to-header

    Note over Prometheus,Metrics: Flow 2: Metrics Collection
    Prometheus->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/9090
    Note over Metrics: Auth: ServiceAccount bearer token<br/>validated against K8s API
    Metrics-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics

    Note over Health: Flow 3: Health Probes
    Envoy->>Health: gRPC Health check<br/>plaintext/9005
    Health-->>Envoy: Health status (SERVING)
